    <string name="about_title">About NitroBoost</string>
    <string name="about_text">Version 1.10.0 — a journal-based game booster with paired adaptive trials, measured-only metrics, and local confidence-aware decisions. Every system change is recorded and reversible. Thermal safety outranks performance; failed restores stay journaled and are retried.</string>

